   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs that take «sein»",
     "texto": [
      "Verbs of **movement** from one place to another, and a few others, form the Perfekt with **sein** instead of «haben»: **Ich bin nach München gefahren** (I went to Munich).",
      "The most important ones: gehen → **gegangen**, fahren → **gefahren**, kommen → **gekommen**, fliegen (to fly) → **geflogen**, bleiben (to stay) → **geblieben**.",
      "In separable verbs, **ge-** goes in the middle: ankommen (to arrive) → **angekommen**, ausgehen (to go out) → **ausgegangen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
